  "description": "Universal multi-domain agent system with 236 specialized agents. V8.6 features: Claude Code Agent Teams integration for parallel team-based execution (40-60% time reduction), /team command with peer-to-peer communication, shared task lists, self-claiming work items. Plus: 100% SKILL.md progressive disclosure migration, Claude Code hooks (12 types), 4-tier model routing, session management (waypoints, recovery), metrics infrastructure, evaluation framework, CI/CD scripts. CSV-based task inventory (60-80% context savings). Controller-centric question-based delegation across 5 super-domains. Minimum tier 2 enforcement. Parallel execution (50x speedup).",
